# The hypotheses of the public theorems and the predicates that the public
# entry functions depend on, as PublicHypotheses.lean records them, each with
# the row of ADR 0097 that permits it, or UNRESOLVED when no row permits it
# (their number is fixed by PublicHypotheses.unresolvedLimit).
# Each line: <recorded line><TAB><reason>. Rows of ADR 0097: :33 the inputs,
# :38 embedded code, :40 rules not checked against GHC, :44 the translator and
# evaluation, :56 to :58 the antecedents of invariants 1 to 3.
